<title>UK: CRICKET-MIDDLESEX V AUSTRALIA MATCH DRAWN.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-MIDDLESEX V AUSTRALIA MATCH DRAWN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The three-day tour match between</p>
<p>Middlesex and Australia ended in a draw on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: Middlesex 305 and 201-6, Australia 432-7 declared.</p>
</text>
